[
  {
    "id": "ldap_session_full",
    "proto": "ldap",
    "summary": "T-1 全会话（smoke 改写，等价覆盖）：握手3+bindReq/bindResp+searchReq/entry/done+unbind+挥手4=12 包；protocolOp 六标签逐帧",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "ldap": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 13,
      "has_handshake": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "has_payload": true,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "tcp.flags",
          "value": "0x002"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "value": "389"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "tcp.flags",
          "value": "0x012"
        },
        {
          "packet": 3,
          "field": "tcp.flags",
          "value": "0x010"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "value": "389"
        },
        {
          "packet": 8,
          "field": "tcp.flags",
          "value": "0x018"
        },
        {
          "packet": 9,
          "field": "tcp.flags",
          "value": "0x018"
        },
        {
          "packet": 12,
          "field": "tcp.flags",
          "value": "0x010"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "端口 389 由生成器 Plan 缺省（链路径无端口位，D-LDAP-1 裁定3）",
        "包4 bindReq(up)/包5 bindResp(down)/包6 searchReq(up)/包7 entry(down)/包8 done(down)/包9 unbind(up)——BER 应用标签 60/61/63/64/65/42 在 TCP 载荷首字节（frames 钉）",
        "BER 恒长形（berWrap 0x84+4B 长度，实现语义）：bindReq SEQ len 0x10=16；searchReq 0x158=344（15 属性 RootDSE）；unbind len 5+42 00 NULL op"
      ],
      "frames": [
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "30 84 00 00 00 10 02 01 01 60"
        },
        {
          "packet": 5,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "30 84 00 00 00 10 02 01 01 61"
        },
        {
          "packet": 6,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "30 84 00 00 01 58 02 01 02 63"
        },
        {
          "packet": 9,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "30 84 00 00 00 05 02 01 03 42 00"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "ldap_ber_long_form_length",
    "proto": "ldap",
    "summary": "T-2 BER 长形长度字节：15 属性 RootDSE searchReq 消息 >127B → 外层 SEQUENCE 30 84 长形 4B 长度前缀（RFC 4511 §4.1.1）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "ldap": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 13,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "value": "389"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "外层 SEQUENCE 与内层 protocolOp 均长形：30 84 + 4B 长度 / 60 84 + 4B 长度（RFC 4511 §4.1.1 长形面）",
        "bindReq 内层 len 0x07=version(3)+name(2)+simple(2)；searchReq 外层 len 0x158=344",
        "offset 63=54+SEQ 6B+messageID 3B（bindReq protocolOp 起点）"
      ],
      "frames": [
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "offset": 63,
          "hex": "60 84 00 00 00 07 02 01 03"
        },
        {
          "packet": 6,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "30 84 00 00 01 58"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "ldap_message_id_increment",
    "proto": "ldap",
    "summary": "T-3 messageID 递增钉：rounds=2 → bind id {1,4}/search id {2,5}/unbind id 3",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "ldap": {
            "rounds": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 18,
      "has_handshake": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "value": "389"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "3 握手+2 轮×5 消息+unbind+4 挥手=17",
        "messageID 实测钉：帧4=1(bindReq)/帧9=4(bindReq r2)/帧11=5(searchReq r2)/帧14=6(unbind=base+3(r-1)+2)；帧6 searchReq id 2 同 T-1"
      ],
      "frames": [
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "30 84 00 00 00 10 02 01 01 60"
        },
        {
          "packet": 9,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "30 84 00 00 00 10 02 01 04 60"
        },
        {
          "packet": 11,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "30 84 00 00 01 58 02 01 05 63"
        },
        {
          "packet": 14,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "30 84 00 00 00 05 02 01 06 42 00"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "ldap_bind_anonymous",
